<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ economic projections released on Sept 18.</title>
<headline>RBNZ economic projections released on Sept 18.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Wednesday it will release its September Economic Projects at 9.00 a.m. (2100 GMT) on Thursday September 18.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
